04, 122.4757, 529.2805, 127, 0, 0, 1, Captain\\_Nathan\\_Flock\nP -143.1404, 71.3907, 199.2808, 127, 0, 0, 1, Brexx\\_Darkpaw\nP -138.6061, 42.9383, 199.2808, 127, 0, 0, 1, Brexx\\_Darkpaw\nP -58.4753, 125.4423, 399.2807, 127, 0, 0, 1, Commander\\_Kurt\\_Ellis\nP -54.7803, -73.3092, 399.2806, 127, 0, 0, 1, Commander\\_Kurt\\_Ellis\nP -123.8751, -81.3455, 99.2808, 127, 0, 0, 1, Garath\\_Sulfada\nP -47.1209, 76.8843, 99.2808, 127, 0, 0, 1, Garath\\_Sulfada\nP -95.0026, -100.9431, 299.2806, 127, 0, 0, 1, Vicar\\_Lucilia\\_Belyea\nP -67.1587, -114.0166, 299.2806, 127, 0, 0, 1, Vicar\\_Lucilia\\_Belyea\nP 22.2063, -72.4893, 103.2130, 127, 0, 0, 1, Guardian\\_Roger\\_Macholeth\\_(heroic)\nP 142.1294, 50.1449, -850.3542, 127, 0, 0, 1, Mad\\_Martyr\\_(A\\_Rotten\\_Heart)\n_NOTE: \"Mad Martyr\" and \"Guardian Roger Macholeth\" are found in instanced zones. \"Mad Martyr\" appears in \"A Rotten Heart\" (the first mission for the Tower of Rot), and \"Guardian Roger Macholeth\" can spawn in the heroic adventure for the Tower of Rot, \"Brendaleen's Scheme\"._",
