      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Tower of Rot [zone=999]\n**Who:**\n- Deidre Harath [npc=47047]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Scion Missives [item=116854]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Foreman Lavers [ _Bayle's Minion_]\n- Kentash Andebar [npc=47062]\n- Sergeant Whisken [ _Bayle's Minion_]\n- a rockbreaker [npc=47071]\n- an excavator [npc=47133]\n**Related Quests:**\n- A Rotten Heart [quest=7537]\n- Raid Expedition: Lord Kyle Bayle [quest=7539]\n- The Fall of Lord Bayle [quest=7538]\n- Tower of Rot #1: The Scions of the Tower [quest=7531]\n- Tower of Rot #3: Fenn's Job [quest=7533]\n- Tower of Rot #4: Narius' Plan [quest=7534]\n- Tower of Rot #5: The Adana Problem [quest=7535]\n- Tower of Rot #6: The Source of Rot [quest=7536]\n**Era:** | !Call of the Forsaken\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed May 21 06:59:48 2014\nModified: Sat Feb 24 21:13:11 2024 |\n---\n\n**Call of the Forsaken Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task is the second in a series of six. It begins with Dedire Harath ( **click for map image**) on the zone-in level of the Tower of Rot._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Completed \"The Scions of the Tower\"\n_Say \"undead\" to request the task._\n\n---\n\n**Summary & Requesting the Task**\n\\- Hail Kentash.\n\\- Kill 5 rockbreakers and/or excavators (one floor below zone-in level).\n\\- Kill Sergeant Whisken and Foreman Lavers (same floor as rockbreakers).\n\\- Pick up 3x \"Scion Missives\" ground spawns (pre-lootable) and turn in to Deidre Harath.\n\\- Hail Deidre Harath.\nYou say, 'Hail, Deidre Harath'\nDeidre Harath says 'I take it you have a pretty good understanding of what we are up against now? Good, because we are going to need all the help we can get. First things first: Before we can even start on Narius' goons, we need to take care of the [undead].'\nYou say, 'What about the undead?'\nDeidre Harath says 'Find out more from Kentash Andebar before doing anything else. Despite not being a combatant, next to you, he's one of the most valuable people here.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Tower's Victims'.\nDeidre Harath has charged you with halting the flow of the undead. Legions of lost occupy large sections of the Tower of Rot.\nKentash Andebar has more information about the undead occupants of the tower. Speak to him.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\n1\\. Discuss the Tower of Rot with Kentash Andebar 0/1 (Tower of Rot)\nYou say, 'Hail, Kentash Andebar'\nKentash Andebar says 'This tower was to be a point of pride of Qeynos. Expeditions were sent. However, workers and soldiers sent never returned, and communication was quickly lost. Kyle Bayle himself was the last party sent, a last attempt. He never returned. After that, the tower project was abandoned, and it aquired its unflattering names, Tower of Rot chief among them. The undead here still work on the tower, constantly rebuilding that which cannot be constructed. It appears that some of them awoke, so to speak, when these Ethernere portals started appearing. You must defeat as many undead as you can, but most importantly, defeat their leaders.'\n\n---\n\n2\\. Eliminate undead workers and soldiers 0/5 (Tower of Rot)\n_Kill rockbreakers and excavators on the floor below the zone-in level._\n3\\. Take out Sergeant Whisken 0/1 (Tower of Rot)\nSergeant Whisken readies their weapon. 'You have caused enough trouble. There will be no quarter.'\n_Sergeant Whisken is a paladin (standard fight for the zone, except more hp than typical trash mobs)._\nSergeant Whisken has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nSergeant Whisken's corpse collapses in pieces.\n4\\. Take out Foreman Lavers 0/1 (Tower of Rot)\nForeman Lavers locks baleful, undead eyes on their prey. 'You interrupt our work.'\n_Foreman Lavers is pure melee (also a standard fight with no tricks)._\nForeman Lavers has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nForeman Lavers's corpse falls apart, the creature's last sound a cry of relief.\n5\\. Search for clues to the Scions of the Towers plans and give them to Harath 0/3 (Tower of Rot)\n_Pick up \"Scion Missives\" ground spawns (found in various locations below and above the zone-in floor)._\nYou offered 3 Scion Missives to Deidre Harath.\nYour task 'The Tower's Victims' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Tower's Victims' has been updated.\nYour task 'The Tower's Victims' has been updated.\nDeidre Harath says 'Ah, you found something? Excellent. We'll need all the information we can get.'\nYou complete the trade with Deidre Harath.\n\n---\n\n6\\. Speak to Deidre Harath 0/1 (Tower of Rot)\nYou say, 'Hail, Deidre Harath'\nYour task 'The Tower's Victims' has been updated.\nYou have received a replay timer for 'The Tower's Victims': 0d:5h:0m remaining.\nYou've destroyed the long dead leaders and discovered more information.\nYou receive 225 platinum .\nYou gain experience!\nDeidre Harath says, 'Professionally done. You've dealt the dead a blow, and now we can concentrate on what truly bothers me - the living.'\nYou've destroyed the long dead leaders and discovered more information.\n\n---\n\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience (about 2% in Level 100)",
